{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000026293","bookName":"Lazos rotos: la sanadora suprema te desterró","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000026293/42000026293.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1638077,"followCount":29894,"introduction":"Amara sacrifica sus poderes de Sanadora Suprema por Marcos, el Alfa, pero las intrigas de su amante la condenan a crueles torturas y a perder a su bebé. Dante, rey de los licántropos, la rescata y ella rompe el vínculo, despierta a su legendaria loba blanca y recupera su magia divina. Al descubrir la verdad, Marcos se impone un duro castigo para recuperarla. Cuando una conspiración mortal amenaza la Boda Real, ¿podrá su último sacrificio salvarla o ya es demasiado tarde?","chapterCount":54,"labels":["Second Chance","Revenge"],"tags":["Second Chance","Revenge"],"typeTwoIds":[349],"typeTwoNames":["Hombre Lobo"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":349,"name":"Hombre Lobo","replaceName":"hombre-lobo"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Hombre-Lobo","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Lazos-rotos-la-sanadora-suprema-te-desterró","bookNameLower":"lazos-rotos-la-sanadora-suprema-te-desterró","shelfTime":"2026-09-08 17:01:52","firstShelfTime":"2026-09-08 17:01:52","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701593078","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/87/3x9/39x2/392x6/39262000024/701593078_1/701593078.720p.wz.h264.mp4?Expires=1795179600&Signature=rwBv17SSCz073ecnwC5tQmQOpXLnMtMAH5X6g5lsEhj7BsQqEWwZyo2Weu5yYZ1cOgl-oaKxpXiK8y612wBNth3hPhc95pS4GicTExv-1kjvfBNGj3cW2lqcvAoKiowlwBlHbZxl~8sU-bdByq04GxTuoYr8pwgikmi~fTfc-3x~OYfVNmOtKGPd9umWbl4FlC-oiEbQ9r3tSvB3CEwiMkV5YHtkFQNrlIUbsd-y7dUVJGRjI653Nk7LmDnpnBIuhCDjLLYPaWrsoPEHxhufbox3YgMe01mqDW3k2dByCj1n5SlA7NTTvLnSmLklDznZgxM8uK8MpGKmXYnr~6aq7w__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/87/3x9/39x2/392x6/39262000024/701593078_1/701593078.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":165185,"price":0},{"id":"701593079","index":1,"unlock":tru